# ThreadSanitizer suppressions of the Linux guest run (ws213-p004, the design's
# 9 節 "Linux の TSan"). Only the Vulkan driver and LLVM inside it are
# suppressed here; a report between the compositor's existing threads goes
# below with its reason and a Bug ticket (asked of Q1); nothing of WS213's own
# threads (input, cursor, render) or locks is ever suppressed.
called_from_lib:libvulkan_lvp.so
called_from_lib:libvulkan_virtio.so
called_from_lib:libvulkan_intel.so
called_from_lib:libvulkan_radeon.so
called_from_lib:libLLVM
